description.text:
One single piercing ranged hybrid attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth/Lightning Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if target has at least 0/40% Imperil Earth/Lightning;
WS Blue: Causes [Imperil Earth/Lightning 30%] to all targets
WS Gold: Causes [DeProtect or DeShell] to all targets

